HHIISSTTOORRYY
       ppaammddiitthheerrbbww was new in Netpbm 10.23 (July 2004), but is essentially the
       same  program as ppggmmttooppbbmm that has existed practically since the begin‐
       ning.  ppaammddiitthheerrbbww differs from its predecessor  in  that  it  properly
       adds brightnesses (using gamma transformations; ppggmmttooppbbmm just adds them
       linearly) and that it accepts PAM input in addition to PGM and PBM  and
       produces PAM output.

       ppaammddiitthheerrbbww obsoletes ppggmmttooppbbmm.

       --aattkkiinnssoonn was new in Netpbm 10.38 (March 2007).


